        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_66859181dc8a4d158043a22255065aec",
      "statement": "In the SDK, searchLex runs only the FTS search with no LLM, searchVector runs only the sqlite-vec search using the store's embedding model, and expandQuery returns typed expansion variants without searching; none of these three runs RRF or reranking, which only the hybridQuery path performs.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/index.ts#L531-L540",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:553557e40578e480e28dcb8677e5e1c948eb8eea3ecb1b77307e6e54b53ee13f:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5c3afd4d24c64caf91bbafe67ec8c899",
      "statement": "search() maps rerank false to skipRerank and passes it through to hybridQuery or structuredSearch, so the reranker is bypassed without changing the search primitives.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/index.ts#L491-L525",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c0c72685696ecfbd6a9ed98fc83990918874017c12e7012ca4917491c4ce0494:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5f40889cbec445de977440ff7ec65d39",
      "statement": "The strong-signal bypass in hybridQuery is disabled whenever an intent is supplied, and it fires only when the top normalized BM25 score is at least STRONG_SIGNAL_MIN_SCORE (0.85) and the gap to the second score is at least STRONG_SIGNAL_MIN_GAP (0.15); the constants are declared at store.ts lines 476-482.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/store.ts#L476-L482",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ce4dd6c64226aed65dfa5e362d3a5344a463ec5d61f4c6451ff82e622e3654a4:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/store.ts#L6294-L6297",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4f5eb39707ca4686c3ce3178b0b91324af95adced22141f9df64e9531d85e722:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_143048333a2741b598080557f2ad162e",
      "statement": "When the strong-signal bypass fires, hybridQuery skips expandQuery entirely (expanded is an empty array) but keeps the BM25 probe list as the original FTS list in fusion, and the original-query vector search still runs.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/store.ts#L6300-L6308",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3813f2a0564c79cff5c6fd7fdc54980c6b3686ae9d6683e52bf60ffad6819748:"
