        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ad03bd783cd04d4687e31289fb7da507",
      "statement": "The normalized BM25 score is |x|/(1+|x|) from the negative FTS5 bm25 value, so the 0.85 threshold corresponds to a raw BM25 magnitude of about 5.7.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/store.ts#L4778-L4790",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f7e3bf5b61245b215f1ab2675920f4761ff07481b028ff57fdea6cf37bdda79a:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2a288a2cf4d743a49ad8826478000873",
      "statement": "Expansion results are routed by type: lex variants run as FTS searches, and vec and hyde variants (plus the original query) are embedded in one embedBatch call and searched via searchVec with precomputed embeddings; the original query is always searched in both FTS and vector form.",
      "evidence": [
        {
