      "statement": "reciprocalRankFusion accumulates weight/(60+rank+1) per list, adds a top-rank bonus of 0.05 for rank 0 and 0.02 for ranks 1 and 2, and sorts by the fused score; hybridQuery uses the default k of 60.",
