      "id": "claim_5c2f3020ed1a49eabb47093055d36eaf",
      "statement": "hybridQuery slices the fused list to candidateLimit (default RERANK_CANDIDATE_LIMIT of 40) and returns an empty array immediately when no candidates remain, before any chunking, reranking, or blending.",
