    {
      "id": "claim_6b8b060baa76486cb21f893bbb9fcbdd",
      "statement": "Chunk selection picks, for each candidate, the chunk with the most query-term hits, adding 0.5 (INTENT_WEIGHT_CHUNK) per intent-term hit; only that best chunk is sent to the reranker, and candidates whose chunking yields no chunks are excluded from the rerank map.",
